{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-20 00:05:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. - LUV', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO.\xa0("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE: LUV). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-19 14:55:00', 'title': 'LUV LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 19, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SOUTHWEST INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. SECURITIES BETWEEN JUNE 13, 2020 AND DECEMBER 31, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-19 13:23:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION REMINDER: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 19, 2023) - THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. ("SOUTHWEST" OR "THE COMPANY") (NYSE: LUV) FOR VIOLATIONS OF §§10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION.'}{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-01-19 12:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LOOMING DEADLINE IN THE CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. (LUV)', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”) REMINDS INVESTORS OF